Description: Dual-track real-time translation addon and Qt6 floating bar for Fcitx5
 ShadowBar provides a lightweight non-blocking translation overlay directly
 alongside Fcitx5 Chinese/CJK/English input plus a Qt6 floating translation
 window (`shadowbar-float`) with Wayland/X11 clipboard monitoring.
 .
 Features:
  * One-Shot (`;;`), Sticky (`Ctrl+Shift+T`), and Virtual IM modes
  * 20 languages with multi-provider routing (OpenAI-compatible, Ollama, DeepL, GoogleFree)
  * Local Hunyuan Hy-MT2-1.8B (2bit Q2_0C GGUF) management with Vulkan/CPU fallback
  * Multi-format offline dictionary support (ECDICT SQLite/CSV, StarDict, CC-CEDICT, JSON/JSONL, TSV)
  * Built-in one-click Chinese environment & IME fixer for Wayland and X11
